# Local classification rules configuration written by a dev run - the
# backend's default LOGEXPLORER_DATA_DIR is the relative ./data, i.e.
# backend/data/ under `mvnw spring-boot:run`, or data/ next to wherever the
# jar is started from. User-authored local state, never committed.
backend/data/
/data/

